  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "等级不低于Lv.45",
      "type": "level-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "1.前往维诺亚村，出村至芙蕾雅岛（299.538）处与士兵塔拉帕对话，选“是”进入维诺亚海底洞窟。",
      "type": "entry-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.通过维诺亚海底洞窟抵达芙蕾雅岛，前往（260.449）处进入炎之洞窟。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "3.与火精莎拉曼达（13.6）对话，选“是”栅栏。通过（25.4）处黄色传送石进入炎之洞窟。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "4.通过随机迷宫抵达炎之洞窟地下16楼，与火精莎拉曼达（23.20）对话，选“是”传送至其他房间。",
      "type": "maze-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "5.与每一个房间的火精莎拉曼达对话，皆选“是”。不断传送直至抵达位于地图东南位置的房间。",
      "type": "teleport-puzzle",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "6.与火精莎拉曼达（77.84）对话，选“是”传送至炎之回廊。",
      "type": "teleport-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "7.与炎之斗神（42.11）对话，选“是”进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "8.战斗胜利后传送至充满谜的房间。调查钢琴（7.2），选“是”获得【炎之乐谱】。",
      "type": "reward-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "9.与火精莎拉曼达（9.4）对话，可交出【纯火水晶】获得【火精的福袋】。",
      "type": "optional-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "10.与火精莎拉曼达（10.2）对话，根据持有的【炎之符】数量兑换对应等级的各色【宝石】1颗并传送芙蕾雅岛（261.478）处。",
      "type": "token-gem-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "11.与火精莎拉曼达（11.4）对话，选“是”传送至芙蕾雅岛（261.478）处，任务完结。",
      "type": "exit-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "【【炎之符】支线】路线1.前往炎之洞窟地下16层，与火精莎拉曼达（23.20）对话，选“是”传送至其他房间。",
      "type": "branch-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "【【炎之符】支线】路线2.与每一个房间的火精莎拉曼达对话，皆选“是”。",
      "type": "branch-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "【【炎之符】支线】路线3.若传送至的房间并非位于地图东南位置且房间内有黄色传送石，则通过黄色传送石抵达炎之洞窟地下1楼。",
      "type": "branch-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "【【炎之符】支线】路线4.通过随机迷宫抵达炎之试炼，与红胄甲（14.33）对话，进入战斗。",
      "type": "branch-battle",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "【【炎之符】支线】路线5.战斗胜利后通过栅栏，与火精莎拉曼达（25.4）对话，获得【炎之符】并传送至炎之洞窟地下16楼，支线完结。",
      "type": "branch-reward",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "◆怀旧服芙蕾雅岛（299.538）处无士兵塔拉帕，可直接进入维诺亚海底洞窟",
      "type": "versioned-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "◆维诺亚海底洞窟为固定迷宫；魔物为Lv.26~27水龙蜥、蜥蜴战士",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "◆等级低于Lv.45无法通过火精莎拉曼达，通过火精莎拉曼达后只可登出离开，炎之洞窟内魔物不可封印",
      "type": "gate-and-exit-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
