        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "◆炎之洞窟地下16楼为固定迷宫；魔物皆为全25属性的Lv.40~50地狱猎犬、罗刹",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
